帝時更曰傅。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉诸王国有太傅，至成帝时更曰傅。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":140,"tongjian_id":"967a5810-db0e-11ef-bbdf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"侍御史","official_note":"侍御史是汉代监察官职，负责弹劾官员、监督司法，此处沈景被任命为河间相，显示其能力被皇帝认可，用于整顿河间国政。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"帝以侍御史吳郡沈景有強能","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"03404bab-b3bd-4044-bec0-fce41b6789ec"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河間相","official_note":"河间相是汉代诸侯国河间国的相，负责辅佐和监督诸侯王，此处沈景被任命此职以纠正河间王政的不法行为。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"擢爲河間相","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9c6f8644-b9bb-4210-8f26-f0f969bc32cf"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍郞","official_note":"侍郞是汉代宫廷官职，常负责礼仪和侍从，此处侍郞在河间王谒见时赞拜，显示其在场执行礼仪职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"侍郞贊拜","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"e54c881c-ca84-48b1-9fdb-8301859f087c"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"虎賁","official_note":"虎賁是汉代禁卫军官职，负责宫廷护卫，此处虎賁回应沈景的询问，表明其在场护卫河间王。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"虎賁曰","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"dc4adcdc-b3c0-481f-ad4c-2d9a18dfa391"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"王傅","official_note":"王傅是汉代诸侯王的师傅，负责教导和辅佐王，此处沈景责备王傅未能训导河间王，显示其失职。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"請王傅責之曰","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"d2e61853-3577-4ee9-82ce-a1569e243e48"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"河間孝王","people_name_jianti_auto":"河间孝王","people_xingming":"刘开","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"967a5816-db0e-11ef-870c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"開","people_name_jianti_auto":"开","people_xingming":"刘开","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"967a5817-db0e-11ef-b7c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"刘政，东汉河间惠王，汉章帝的孙子，河间孝王刘开的长子。","link_td_id":"Q10021516","link_td_number_id":7256830,"people_name":"政","people_name_jianti_auto":"政","people_xingming":"刘政","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"967a5818-db0e-11ef-bda2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"刘政，东汉河间惠王，汉章帝的孙子，河间孝王刘开的长子。","link_td_id":"Q10021516","link_td_number_id":7256830,"people_name":"政","people_name_jianti_auto":"政","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"967a5819-db0e-11ef-81eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"沈景","people_name_jianti_auto":"沈景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"967a581a-db0e-11ef-9d81-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"967a581d-db0e-11ef-ba7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"967a581e-db0e-11ef-8f9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"967a581f-db0e-11ef-a01f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"967a5820-db0e-11ef-ae7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"刘政，东汉河间惠王，汉章帝的孙子，河间孝王刘开的长子。","link_td_id":"Q10021516","link_td_number_id":7256830,"people_name":"政","people_name_jianti_auto":"政","people_xingming":"刘政","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"967a5822-db0e-11ef-b53e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","people_xingming":"沈景","start_index":193,"tongjian_id":"967a5823-db0e-11ef-a3b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"刘政，东汉河间惠王，汉章帝的孙子，河间孝王刘开的长子。","link_td_id":"Q10021516","link_td_number_id":7256830,"people_name":"政","people_name_jianti_auto":"政","people_xingming":"刘政","start_index":221,"tongjian_id":"967a5824-db0e-11ef-8fa3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴郡","resolved_place_entity_id":34,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"967a581b-db0e-11ef-bd65-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间","resolved_place_entity_id":581,"start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"967a581c-db0e-11ef-882a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":145,"tongjian_id":"967a5821-db0e-11ef-bfaa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"1春，二月，庚午，河間孝王開薨；子政嗣。政慠很不奉法，帝以侍御史吳郡沈景有強能，擢爲河間相。景到國，謁王，王不正服，箕踞殿上；侍郞贊拜，景峙不爲禮，問王所在。虎賁曰：「是非王邪！」景曰：「王不正服，常人何別！今相謁王，豈謁無禮者邪！」王慙而更服，景然後拜；出，住宮門外，請王傅責之曰：「前發京師，陛見受詔，以王不恭，相使檢督。諸君空受爵祿，曾無訓導之義！」因奏治其罪，詔書讓政而詰責傅。景因捕諸姦人，奏案其罪，殺戮尤惡者數十人，出冤獄百餘人。政遂爲改節，悔過自脩。","content_fanyi":"春季，二月十七日庚午，河间孝王刘开去世；他的儿子刘政继位。刘政骄横凶狠，不遵守法令，汉顺帝认为侍御史、吴郡人沈景刚强能干，提拔他为河间国相。沈景到河间国后进见河间王刘政，刘政不穿诸侯王官服，叉开双腿傲慢地坐在殿上；侍郎唱名让沈景拜见，沈景却故意站着不行礼，反问大王在哪里。虎贲卫士说：“这不就是大王吗！”沈景说：“大王不穿王袍，与平常百姓有什么区别！如今国相拜见的是大王，岂能拜见无礼之人！”刘政惭愧地更换衣服，沈景这才行拜礼；出来后停在宫门外，请来河间王傅，责备他说：“前几天我从京都洛阳动身，在皇上面前接受诏书，因为河间王不恭敬，所以设国相来检查督责。各位白白领受爵禄，却没有一点训导的职责！”于是沈景上奏请求治他们的罪，汉顺帝下诏责备刘政，并追责河间王傅。沈景又逮捕那些奸恶之人，上奏查办他们的罪行，处死其中特别恶劣的数十人，释放蒙冤入狱的一百多人。刘政从此改变操守，悔过自新。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，二月，庚午，河间孝王开薨；子政嗣。政慠很不奉法，帝以侍御史吴郡沈景有强能，擢为河间相。景到国，谒王，王不正服，箕踞殿上；侍郞赞拜，景峙不为礼，问王所在。虎贲曰：「是非王邪！」景曰：「王不正服，常人何别！今相谒王，岂谒无礼者邪！」王慙而更服，景然后拜；出，住宫门外，请王傅责之曰：「前发京师，陛见受诏，以王不恭，相使检督。诸君空受爵禄，曾无训导之义！」因奏治其罪，诏书让政而诘责傅。景因捕诸奸人，奏案其罪，杀戮尤恶者数十人，出冤狱百余人。政遂为改节，悔过自修。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4308,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"967a5809-db0e-11ef-984c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":11,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見四十七卷和帝永元二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9574817a-db0e-11ef-8be3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"和帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"和帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"967a5828-db0e-11ef-9c42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見四十七卷和帝永元二年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见四十七卷和帝永元二年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"967a5827-db0e-11ef-85a9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"伊吾司馬","official_note":"伊吾司馬是漢代在伊吾地區設置的軍事官員，負責屯田和邊防事務。在《資治通鑒》此段中，漢順帝因伊吾地近西域且匈奴常侵擾，故恢復屯田並設置此官以加強防禦。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"置伊吾司馬一人","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"bf49890a-21de-49af-9933-a99d5f93e1a3"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","resolved_place_entity_id":1031,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"967a5829-db0e-11ef-9c20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","resolved_place_entity_id":259,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"967a582a-db0e-11ef-abb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"967a582b-db0e-11ef-a469-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","resolved_place_entity_id":1031,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"967a582c-db0e-11ef-b4f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与西域各国的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0614"},{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"和平初，北匈奴呼衍王攻伊吾屯城。诏敦煌太守马达将兵救之，...","context_before":"...宗奏遣行长史索班复屯伊吾。既而为北匈奴及车师后王所攻没。","source_end_index":236,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"eca1e0a3-5547-5b13-875f-5b0e378ccd89","source_start_index":198,"source_text":"永建四年，以伊吾膏腴地，旁近西域，匈奴资之为钞暴，乃复开设屯田，置伊吾司马。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"2帝以伊吾膏腴之地，傍近西域，匈奴資之以爲鈔暴；三月，辛亥，復令開設屯田，如永元時事，置伊吾司馬一人。","content_fanyi":"汉顺帝因为伊吾一带土地肥沃，又靠近西域，匈奴凭借这里作为抄掠施暴、侵扰中原的基地；三月二十九日辛亥，他再次下令开设屯田，如同和帝永元年间旧例，设置伊吾司马一人。","content_jianti_auto":"2帝以伊吾膏腴之地，傍近西域，匈奴资之以为钞暴；三月，辛亥，复令开设屯田，如永元时事，置伊吾司马一人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4309,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"967a5825-db0e-11ef-b167-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"967a582f-db0e-11ef-8315-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"穨，徒回翻。賢曰：詩·小雅曰：鞠爲茂草。註云：鞠，窮也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"穨，徒回翻。贤曰：诗·小雅曰：鞠为茂草。注云：鞠，穷也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"967a582e-db0e-11ef-8625-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蕘豎，刈草者也。蕘，如招翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"荛竖，刈草者也。荛，如招翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"967a5832-db0e-11ef-87fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"博士","official_note":"博士是漢代掌管經學傳授和學術研究的官職，屬於太學系統，負責教授學生和參與國家禮儀。在上下文中，博士不復講習反映了安帝時期學術衰敗的狀況。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"博士不復講習","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c24db9c8-5948-4af8-a148-d179b42e7e31"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"工程營造","official_name":"將作大匠","official_note":"將作大匠是漢代負責宮殿、陵墓等大型建築工程的官職，屬於中央機構。在上下文中，翟酺作為將作大匠上疏請求修繕太學，促成了太學的重建。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"將作大匠翟酺上疏請脩繕","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"1aa28f3b-b786-4bbf-8c30-1ce96cb7344e"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":94,"link_death_year":125,"link_td_description":"汉安帝刘祜，东汉皇帝（106年9月21日－125年4月30日在位），汉章帝孙，清河王刘庆之子，在位19年，其正式谥号为“孝安皇帝”，后世省略“孝”字称“汉安帝”。","link_td_id":"Q10000316","link_td_number_id":103543,"people_name":"安帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"安帝","people_xingming":"刘祜","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"967a5834-db0e-11ef-97ae-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘祜]"},{"link_td_description":"翟酺，字子超，广汉雒人，东汉人。好《老子》之学，尤善长图纬、天文、历算。后来因为杀人，流亡长安，以算命为业，后来在凉州牧羊。遇赦还，征拜议郎，迁侍中。安帝时，补尚书。","link_td_id":"Q10007348","link_td_number_id":1494211,"people_name":"翟酺","people_name_jianti_auto":"翟酺","people_xingming":"翟酺","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"967a5835-db0e-11ef-9017-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"967a582d-db0e-11ef-a655-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"pú","source_anchor_text":"作大匠翟酺上疏請脩","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":50,"text":"酺","tongjian_id":"0ee67541-b516-574d-a5ae-58e543b9a64e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3初，安帝薄於藝文，博士不復講習，朋徒相視怠散，學舍穨敝，鞠爲園蔬，或牧兒、蕘豎薪刈其下。將作大匠翟酺上疏請脩繕，誘進後學，帝從之。秋，九月，繕起太學，凡所造構二百四十房，千八百五十室。","content_fanyi":"当初，安帝不重视文献经术，博士不再讲习，门徒们彼此观望，日渐懈怠涣散，学舍倾颓破败，沦为菜园，甚至牧童、樵夫也在太学下面割草砍柴。将作大匠翟酺上疏请求修缮，劝导后学上进，顺帝听从了他的建议。秋季，九月，修缮重建太学，共建造二百四十栋房屋、一千八百五十间屋室。","content_jianti_auto":"3初，安帝薄于艺文，博士不复讲习，朋徒相视怠散，学舍穨敝，鞠为园蔬，或牧儿、荛竖薪刈其下。将作大匠翟酺上疏请修缮，诱进后学，帝从之。秋，九月，缮起太学，凡所造构二百四十房，千八百五十室。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，非不知务也。使得丙吉之量，宋璟、张九龄之节，韩琦之忠，...","context_before":"...，任左雄之策清吏治，非不明也。樊英、黄琼、郎凯公车接轸，","source_end_index":208,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"619f4e9b-43fe-4a16-9c6a-3f2caa88191f","source_start_index":198,"source_text":"纳翟酺之说，广拓学宫"}],"title":"一 顺帝时有君无臣"}],"id":4310,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"967a582d-db0e-11ef-a655-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_